{
  "id": "steam_heating_processes___load_calculating",
  "title": "Steam Heating Processes - Load Calculating",
  "description": "Calculate heat transfer rates and steam requirements for both batch and continuous heating processes using steam. Determine the quantity of energy needed to change or maintain product/fluid temperature.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Steam Heating Processes - Load Calculating\n\nThis tool calculates heat transfer and steam requirements for steam heating applications.\n\n## Non-Flow (Batch) Heating\n**Formula:** P = m × cp × dT / t\n\n- **P** = Mean heat transfer rate (kW)\n- **m** = Mass of product (kg)\n- **cp** = Specific heat of product (kJ/kg·°C)\n- **dT** = Temperature change (°C)\n- **t** = Total heating time (seconds)\n\n## Flow (Continuous) Heating\n**Formula:** P = cp × dT × (m/t)\n\n- **P** = Mean heat transfer rate (kW)\n- **m/t** = Mass flow rate (kg/s)\n- **cp** = Specific heat of product (kJ/kg·°C)\n- **dT** = Temperature change (°C)\n\n## Steam Requirement\n**Formula:** ms = P / he\n\n- **ms** = Mass of steam (kg/s)\n- **P** = Heat transfer rate (kW)\n- **he** = Evaporation energy of steam (kJ/kg)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Batch Heating",
        "Calculation"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "batch_mass",
          "label": "Product Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_cp",
          "label": "Specific Heat Capacity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg·°C",
          "defaultValue": 4.19
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_temp_initial",
          "label": "Initial Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 35
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_temp_final",
          "label": "Final Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_time",
          "label": "Heating Time",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "seconds",
          "defaultValue": 1200
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_steam_energy",
          "label": "Steam Evaporation Energy",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 2085
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "batch_temp_change",
          "label": "Temperature Change",
          "unit": "°C",
          "formula": "inputs.batch_temp_final - inputs.batch_temp_initial"
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_heat_transfer_rate",
          "label": "Heat Transfer Rate",
          "unit": "kW",
          "formula": "(inputs.batch_mass * inputs.batch_cp * (inputs.batch_temp_final - inputs.batch_temp_initial)) / inputs.batch_time"
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_steam_rate",
          "label": "Steam Flow Rate",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "((inputs.batch_mass * inputs.batch_cp * (inputs.batch_temp_final - inputs.batch_temp_initial)) / inputs.batch_time) / inputs.batch_steam_energy"
        },
        {
          "id": "batch_steam_rate_hourly",
          "label": "Steam Flow Rate",
          "unit": "kg/h",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(((inputs.batch_mass * inputs.batch_cp * (inputs.batch_temp_final - inputs.batch_temp_initial)) / inputs.batch_time) / inputs.batch_steam_energy) * 3600"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Continuous Heating",
        "Calculation"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Product Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "defaultValue": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_cp",
          "label": "Specific Heat Capacity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg·°C",
          "defaultValue": 4.19
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_temp_initial",
          "label": "Initial Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_temp_final",
          "label": "Final Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 60
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_steam_energy",
          "label": "Steam Evaporation Energy",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 2030
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_temp_change",
          "label": "Temperature Change",
          "unit": "°C",
          "formula": "inputs.flow_temp_final - inputs.flow_temp_initial"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_heat_transfer_rate",
          "label": "Heat Transfer Rate",
          "unit": "kW",
          "formula": "inputs.flow_cp * (inputs.flow_temp_final - inputs.flow_temp_initial) * inputs.flow_rate"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_steam_rate",
          "label": "Steam Flow Rate",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.flow_cp * (inputs.flow_temp_final - inputs.flow_temp_initial) * inputs.flow_rate) / inputs.flow_steam_energy"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_steam_rate_hourly",
          "label": "Steam Flow Rate",
          "unit": "kg/h",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "((inputs.flow_cp * (inputs.flow_temp_final - inputs.flow_temp_initial) * inputs.flow_rate) / inputs.flow_steam_energy) * 3600"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}